<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Rentsure plans 10-for-one share split.</title>
<headline>Rentsure plans 10-for-one share split.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial holding company Rentsure Ltd said on Thursday it planned a 10-for-one share split to improve the marketability of its stock.</p>
<p>The sub-division is effective from June 2, subject to shareholder approval.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
